tle_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1460602027:1":{"text":"ぜひ飲んでみて、ドリーさん。","source_cn":"我想让你尝尝，多莉小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DC29C668411078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1460602028:1":{"text":"これは……こんな味わいになるなんて……！","source_cn":"……这真是……我完全没有想过的风味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF246BDC82C4CF11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1460602029:1":{"text":"たぶん、あれとあれにひと手間加えているんだと思いますけど……どうやったんでしょう？","source_cn":"我好像知道你对哪几种材料做了特殊的处理，但具体是什么处理呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59172EFEC10D8584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1460602030:1":{"text":"パンドラさん、教えてもらえませんか？新しいアイデアが生まれそうなんです！","source_cn":"潘多拉小姐，可以告诉我吗？我感觉又有了很多新的灵感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BEF299554580B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1460602031:1":{"text":"ええ、もちろん……知りたいと思ってもらえるだけでも、すごく嬉しいわ。","source_cn":"当然可以……你愿意了解，我再开心不过了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x661C00B935BD4570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52: